    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/6c4ac9f8209c0930600d0f48da3e4ed2.poster.avif?t=1754317482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/6c4ac9f8209c0930600d0f48da3e4ed2.webm?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/6c4ac9f8209c0930600d0f48da3e4ed2.mp4?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Crown Gambit is a <strong>narrative tactical game</strong> in which you guide three paladins down an ominous path, through a capital plagued by <strong>chaos and political unrest. </strong><br><br>Pledge allegiance to one of the pretenders to the throne and help them ascend to power. <strong>Follow your own principles but be careful</strong>, as your choices often come at a price!<br><br>Pick a side among plotters and use ancestral relics to defeat your foes, from power-hungry knights to cunning nobles and rebel commoners.<br><br><strong>What will you sacrifice to save the kingdom? Which heir to the throne will you champion? The realm\u2019s destiny lies in your hands.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/c243e7debd4d51885650015aa5c3678e.poster.avif?t=1754317482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/c243e7debd4d51885650015aa5c3678e.webm?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/c243e7debd4d51885650015aa5c3678e.mp4?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CARVE YOUR OWN PATH THROUGH THE CHAOS</strong></h2><br>The kingdom of Meodred's tenuous balance of power is being shaken to its core by a <strong>terrible political crisis</strong>, while mystical forces appear to be pulling strings from the darkness. Each pretender to the throne is rallying their troops to seize the crown, as the commoners forment a revolt and the tide rises still... <strong>At the heart of this turmoil, you play as three novice relic-wielding paladins of the crown forced to make difficult decisions</strong> to ensure the kingdom doesn't descend into chaos.<br><br>Refine your paladins' personalities through dreadful choices along the story and stay true to your own principles. <strong>Pick your allies wisely and navigate through rivalries to foil conspiracies.</strong> But trust no one: in times of chaos, duplicity reigns supreme.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/77237875f8df772058e1b9159dc95564.poster.avif?t=1754317482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/77237875f8df772058e1b9159dc95564.webm?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/77237875f8df772058e1b9159dc95564.mp4?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEEL THE IMPACT IN EPIC BOARD-SHATTERING CARD COMBATS</strong></h2><br>Control a trio of paladins in close-quarter tactical combat: <strong>Aliza</strong>, the blood-bending swashbuckler, <strong>Hael</strong>, the mace-swinging cleric, and <strong>Rollo</strong>, the anchor-waving tanker. Experience the might of your blows through impactful attack animations as you <strong>smash through enemies with your sacred relic weapons.</strong> Stay on your guard, as other powerful paladins follow their own allegiances - and they won't go down without a fight.<br><br>Prepare yourself during your travels and build the deck of each paladin carefully to overcome any obstacle in your way. <strong>Become a well-oiled united team fighting their adversaries and making each blow count - with style.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/eed8cde0fd7ee02c2435d7a381118273.poster.avif?t=1754317482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/eed8cde0fd7ee02c2435d7a381118273.webm?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/eed8cde0fd7ee02c2435d7a381118273.mp4?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POWER IS A DOUBLE-EDGED SWORD</strong></h2><br>Channel dark and ancient power through your holy relics and <strong>turn the tides of battle by calling upon Ancestral Grace</strong>. You will certainly slash through your foes quicker but beware, as the price for this godly strenght may well be your soul...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/e88b0edd67245b25c56c88871d3f2ec4.poster.avif?t=1754317482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/e88b0edd67245b25c56c88871d3f2ec4.webm?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/e88b0edd67245b25c56c88871d3f2ec4.mp4?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Influence Meodred\u2019s fate:</strong> choose your allies and enemies carefully to unveil the story's many twists and turns, including its manifold endings.<br></li><li> <strong>Play as a team of three fearless paladins entangled in this political chaos:</strong> Aliza, the blood-bending swashbuckler, Hael, the mace-wielding cleric, and Rollo, the anchor-waving tanker.<br></li><li> <strong>Face low-life bandits, mighty knights, and unearthly beasts</strong> in tactical turn-based card battles, and unlock devastating techniques to shape each paladin\u2019s combat style. <br></li><li> <strong>Channel the dark powers of the Ancestral Grace</strong> to deliver powerful blows. Be careful: this magic\u2019s influence might have more of a hold on you than you think. <br></li><li> <strong>Journey through a mysterious dark-fantasy universe</strong> inspired by Celtic and Breton folklore, full of eldritch mysteries.  <br></li><li> <strong>Enjoy bold, expressionist hand-drawn illustrations</strong> by Gobert and a haunting medieval soundtrack with a modern twist.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/6c4ac9f8209c0930600d0f48da3e4ed2.poster.avif?t=1754317482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/6c4ac9f8209c0930600d0f48da3e4ed2.webm?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/6c4ac9f8209c0930600d0f48da3e4ed2.mp4?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Crown Gambit is a <strong>narrative tactical game</strong> in which you guide three paladins down an ominous path, through a capital plagued by <strong>chaos and political unrest. </strong><br><br>Pledge allegiance to one of the pretenders to the throne and help them ascend to power. <strong>Follow your own principles but be careful</strong>, as your choices often come at a price!<br><br>Pick a side among plotters and use ancestral relics to defeat your foes, from power-hungry knights to cunning nobles and rebel commoners.<br><br><strong>What will you sacrifice to save the kingdom? Which heir to the throne will you champion? The realm\u2019s destiny lies in your hands.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/c243e7debd4d51885650015aa5c3678e.poster.avif?t=1754317482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/c243e7debd4d51885650015aa5c3678e.webm?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/c243e7debd4d51885650015aa5c3678e.mp4?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CARVE YOUR OWN PATH THROUGH THE CHAOS</strong></h