ght.<br><br>Prepare yourself during your travels and build the deck of each paladin carefully to overcome any obstacle in your way. <strong>Become a well-oiled united team fighting their adversaries and making each blow count - with style.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/eed8cde0fd7ee02c2435d7a381118273.poster.avif?t=1754317482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/eed8cde0fd7ee02c2435d7a381118273.webm?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/eed8cde0fd7ee02c2435d7a381118273.mp4?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POWER IS A DOUBLE-EDGED SWORD</strong></h2><br>Channel dark and ancient power through your holy relics and <strong>turn the tides of battle by calling upon Ancestral Grace</strong>. You will certainly slash through your foes quicker but beware, as the price for this godly strenght may well be your soul...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/e88b0edd67245b25c56c88871d3f2ec4.poster.avif?t=1754317482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/e88b0edd67245b25c56c88871d3f2ec4.webm?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447980/extras/e88b0edd67245b25c56c88871d3f2ec4.mp4?t=1754317482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Influence Meodred\u2019s fate:</strong> choose your allies and enemies carefully to unveil the story's many twists and turns, including its manifold endings.<br></li><li> <strong>Play as a team of three fearless paladins entangled in this political chaos:</strong> Aliza, the blood-bending swashbuckler, Hael, the mace-wielding cleric, and Rollo, the anchor-waving tanker.<br></li><li> <strong>Face low-life bandits, mighty knights, and unearthly beasts</strong> in tactical turn-based card battles, and unlock devastating techniques to shape each paladin\u2019s combat style. <br></li><li> <strong>Channel the dark powers of the Ancestral Grace</strong> to deliver powerful blows. Be careful: this magic\u2019s influence might have more of a hold on you than you think. <br></li><li> <strong>Journey through a mysterious dark-fantasy universe</strong> inspired by Celtic and Breton folklore, full of eldritch mysteries.  <br></li><li> <strong>Enjoy bold, expressionist hand-drawn illustrations</strong> by Gobert and a haunting medieval soundtrack with a modern twist.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Play as three intrepid paladins through a terrible war of succession to save a sinister medieval kingdom from political turmoil. Pick a side amongst noble families to choose the future monarch and crush those who stand in your way through board-shattering tactical card combat!",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Russian",
    "reviews": "\u201cWe've been waiting for it since our first preview a few months ago, and Crown Gambit doesn't disappoint: rich, full of twists and turns and narrativo-tactical choices. A real \u201ccoup de coeur\u201d for this highly original title.\u201d<br />\r\n16/20 \u2013 Jeux Vid\u00e9o Magazine<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201c(...) a devilishly gripping classic.\u201d<br />\r\n8/10 \u2013 Gamehope.com<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cWith Crown Gambit, Wild Wits doesn't just offer us a deck-building game that's as intuitive as it is fun: it also plunges us into the heart of a captivating war of succession, skilfully staged in a universe bursting with charm. We're hooked, and we want more!\u201d<br />\r\n18/20 \u2013 Total Jeux Vid\u00e9o<br />\r\n",
